From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shawn Zhang <shawn.zhang@pepperstone.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 18:15:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Deny China-related CAs from Mozilla CCADB scan

Downstream Vanadium feature: reject TLS chains whose SPKI set intersects
the compiled denylist of China-related roots (BJCA/CFCA/GDCA/SHECA/
iTrusChina/TrustAsia/Hongkong Post, etc.), scanned from Mozilla Included
CA list. Runs before whitelist host pins.


